  "description": "Hosts a single-page application from ASP.NET Core: serves its static files, starts and proxies to the Angular CLI dev server in development, and serves the default page in production. The prerendering middleware itself lives in MintPlayer.AspNetCore.SpaServices.Prerendering.",
